From: =?UTF-8?q?Miguel=20=C3=81ngel=20Pastor=20Olivar?=
 <migue@planetscale.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:41:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] PROTOTYPE (B): fail instead of deferring when the shard lock
 is held
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

For measuring design B against A in the chaos harness; not for review.
Startup returns the error, so vttablet exits; a restore fails and the tablet
stays RESTORE. A restart that skips the restore because mysqld already has
data initializes replication, as a start without a restore does. The
deferral machinery stays in the code but is never entered.

Signed-off-by: Miguel Ángel Pastor Olivar <migue@planetscale.com>
---
 go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/restore.go       |  7 ++
 .../startup_exit_on_lock_test.go              | 84 +++++++++++++++++++
 go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/tm_init.go       | 12 +--
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/startup_exit_on_lock_test.go

diff --git a/go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/restore.go b/go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/restore.go
index 4145124c51..422fe4af77 100644
--- a/go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/restore.go
+++ b/go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/restore.go
@@ -611,6 +611,13 @@ func (rt *restoreStateManager) start(ctx context.Context) (bool, error) {
 	}
 	if !ok {
 		rt.logger.Infof("Attempting to restore, but mysqld already contains data. Assuming vttablet was just restarted.")
+		// A restart can follow a restore that failed to initialize replication,
+		// so initialize it as a start without a restore does.
+		if !rt.deleteBeforeRestore {
+			if _, err := rt.tm.initializeReplicationUnlessShardLocked(ctx, rt.logger, rt.tm.Tablet().Type); err != nil {
+				return false, vterrors.Wrap(err, "failed to initialize replication")
+			}
+		}
 		return false, nil
 	}
 
diff --git a/go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/startup_exit_on_lock_test.go b/go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/startup_exit_on_lock_test.go
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..28fffb9412
--- /dev/null
+++ b/go/vt/vttablet/tabletmanager/startup_exit_on_lock_test.go
@@ -0,0 +1,84 @@
